---
import { readFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
import BackroadPage from '../../features/store-shell/BackroadPage.astro';
export const prerender = false;
let status: any = null;
try { status = JSON.parse(await readFile('/var/lib/backroadbum/telemetry.json','utf8')); } catch {}
const show = (value: unknown, suffix = '') => value === null || value === undefined ? 'Unavailable' : `${value}${suffix}`;
const stale = status ? Date.now() - Date.parse(status.collectedAt) > 180000 : true;
Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control','no-store');
---
<BackroadPage title="The experiment" description="A public record of building and operating Backroad Bum with EmDash and DinkusKit.">
<section class="brb-page dashboard">
  <h1>A store, built in the open.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Backroad Bum is a working merchant experiment for EmDash and DinkusKit. This is the record of what is deployed, what is still missing and what running it teaches us.</p>
  <nav class="dashboard-nav" aria-label="Dashboard sections"><a href="#current">Current state</a><a href="#history">History</a><a href="#contributions">Contributions</a><a href="#costs">Activity & costs</a><a href="#instructions">Instructions</a></nav>
  <section id="current"><h2>Current state</h2><p>Five EmDash-backed products with Commerce pricing, a persistent guest cart and two field notes. Commerce, Payments and Ship run their pinned Registry bundles; Payments and Ship are not connected to fulfillment or payment services yet.</p>
    <dl class="status-list">
      <div><dt>Store process</dt><dd>{show(status?.services?.backroadbum)}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>HTTPS proxy</dt><dd>{show(status?.services?.caddy)}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Admin boundary</dt><dd>{status?.http?.['/_emdash/admin'] === 401 ? 'Authenticated access required (HTTP 401)' : 'Unavailable — check required'}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Test checkout</dt><dd>Not connected · paid order not yet verified</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Checkout refusal</dt><dd>{show(status?.checkout?.prepareHttp, ' HTTP')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>CPU sample</dt><dd>{show(status?.host?.cpuPercent, '%')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Memory used / total</dt><dd>{show(status?.host?.usedMiB)} / {show(status?.host?.totalMiB)} MiB</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Swap used</dt><dd>{show(status?.host?.swapUsedMiB, ' MiB')}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Disk used / total</dt><dd>{show(status?.host?.diskUsedGiB)} / {show(status?.host?.diskTotalGiB)} GiB</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Last local backup</dt><dd>{show(status?.backupAt)}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Visitor / order aggregates</dt><dd>Unavailable · counting is not wired yet</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="small">Metrics refresh independently every minute. Last sample: {show(status?.collectedAt)}{stale ? ' · stale or unavailable' : ''}. A refusal is not proof of a successful payment.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="history"><h2>Build history</h2><article class="cycle-entry"><h3>November 9, 2026 · First deployment</h3><p>Started with an empty workspace and a domain that was not serving HTTPS. Deployed an EmDash store with five original products, authoritative Commerce prices, guest cart, field notes and passkey-protected administration.</p><p>The initial blue-and-yellow brand is provisional. Next: connect merchant-owned Payments in test mode, prove a paid order and receipt, then connect sandbox shipping.</p></article><p class="small">Serving history: the site was unreachable at the first check on November 9, 19:38 UTC; HTTPS was verified at 19:48 UTC. No earlier uptime data is available. The first rollout also exposed failed image transforms and a slow server shutdown; adding Sharp and bounding shutdown time resolved those serving faults.</p></section>
  <section id="contributions"><h2>DinkusKit contributions</h2><p>No upstream issue or PR has been opened for this experiment yet. The first cycle is establishing the store, not proposing framework changes without evidence.</p><table><caption>Fork work deployed here</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Status & purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/saarius/template-store/tree/backroadbum/store">saarius/template-store · backroadbum/store</a></td><td>Branded storefront and Node-hosted merchant demo. Store-specific work, not an upstream proposal.</td></tr><tr><td>Commerce v0.8.0</td><td>Pinned 35f80f218776 · authoritative catalog, manual availability and guest cart</td></tr><tr><td>Payments v0.5.0 / Ship v0.3.1</td><td>Pinned Registry bundles mounted; service connections pending</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
  <section id="costs"><h2>Activity & costs</h2><p>This is the first execution cycle. Completed duration, model/reasoning, tokens, session rotations and compactions are unavailable until cycle accounting is connected; missing values are not zero.</p><dl class="status-list"><div><dt>LLM subscription</dt><dd>$100 / month</dd></div><div><dt>Server</dt><dd>$12 / month</dd></div><div><dt>Domain registration</dt><dd>$20 / year</dd></div><div><dt>API-equivalent model cost</dt><dd>Unavailable</dd></div><div><dt>Actual billed cost to date</dt><dd>Unavailable · budget rates are not an invoice</dd></div></dl></section>
  <section id="instructions"><h2>Owner instructions</h2><p>Instruction versions are kept in order without replacing earlier copies.</p><ul><li><a href="/dashboard/instructions/original-2026-11-09.txt">Original · captured November 9, 2026</a></li></ul></section>
</section>
</BackroadPage>
<style>
.dashboard{max-width:64rem}.dashboard>section{margin-top:3.5rem;scroll-margin-top:2rem}.dashboard-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--store-line);padding:1.5rem 0}.dashboard a{color:inherit}.status-list{max-width:50rem;margin:1.5rem 0}.status-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.5fr;gap:1rem;padding:.7rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--store-line)}.status-list dt{font-weight:600}.status-list dd{margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.small{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--store-muted)}.cycle-entry h3{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:1.1rem}.dashboard table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left}.dashboard caption{text-align:left;font-weight:600;margin:1rem 0}.dashboard th,.dashboard td{vertical-align:top;padding:.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--store-line);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.dashboard th{background:var(--store-surface-subtle)}@media(max-width:40rem){.status-list>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.15rem}.dashboard table{font-size:.85rem}.dashboard th,.dashboard td{padding:.5rem}}
</style>
